for each element of :attr:`input`.

.. math::
    \text{out}_{i} = \exp(-|x|) * i0(x) = \exp(-|x|) * \sum_{k=0}^{\infty} \frac{(\text{input}_{i}^2/4)^k}{(k!)^2}


